OL,3,ACargo ship collides with cruise ship in
OL,4,ANew Orleans as rescuers pull people
OL,5,Afrom water
OL,6,
OL,7,FA tanker ship has collided with a
OL,8,Fdocked cruise ship in New Orleans, with
OL,9,Freports suggesting more than 120 people
OL,10,Fwere on board the cruise ship
OL,12,FA rescue operation has been launched,
OL,13,Fwith people being pulled from the
OL,14,Fwater; images show the cruise ship
OL,15,Flying on its side
OL,17,FLouisiana Governor Jeff Landry says:
OL,18,F"We are aware of the incident on the
OL,19,FMississippi and we are in close contact
OL,20,Fwith local officials and law
OL,21,Fenforcement. I am headed to New Orleans
OL,22,Fnow"
